# QuoteAgent reviewer dashboard (apps/web) — copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in.
# Both are the SAME values as the root .env SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, but Next only
# exposes vars prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ to the browser. The anon key is safe in the client (RLS
# enforces tenant isolation on the caller's JWT — see AC-5). NEVER put the service_role key here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
